  "description": "Official .NET client for LifeAstroAPI (https://lifeastroapi.com), the Vedic astrology and Hindu calendar REST API: panchang, festivals, kundli, dasha, kundli matching, muhurat, transits, horoscopes, numerology, Lal Kitab, remedies, readings and reports in English and 9 Indian languages, plus Western astrology and tarot. Branded PDF reports rendered on your side (Chrome, Edge, Chromium or Gotenberg). 323 async methods, typed errors, retries, credit and rate-limit info. For .NET 8+, ASP.NET Core and .NET Framework 4.6.2+.",
